WEBVTT

00:00:01.518 --> 00:00:07.328
Click Add number and select your provider

00:00:07.328 --> 00:00:11.289
Click the gear to configure provider accounts

00:00:11.289 --> 00:00:14.793
Click Add to connect another account

00:00:14.793 --> 00:00:31.920
Enter a name and the provider's credentials

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:38.586
Click Save

00:00:38.586 --> 00:00:45.599
Close the panel and open Import your own

00:00:45.599 --> 00:00:52.938
Click Import on a number, then confirm

00:00:52.938 --> 00:00:57.985
The imported number appears in All Numbers
